<< /AAPL:AKExtras << /AAPL:AKPDFAnnotationDictionary << /T (yanxia) /AP <<
/N 1182 0 R >> /Border [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (This paper introduced  the first end to end architecture.\012For this architecture, object recognition and patch reordering could use the same network backbone,\012which means the convolutional learning structure and the pretrained models use the same architecture.\012the task is based on the object recognition. \012It extracted the unchangeable features from the labeled data through supervised task, and adaptively fixed the features through unsupervised task.\012the experiment tested on several dataset for 3x3 size\012what the results showed\0121.the unsupervised method is less likely to tell the semantic info correctly\0122.if the weight of the loss alpha is high, the data bais to the relevant radio between the images ordered and shulffed could impact the accuracy significantly.)
/Rect [ 39.20819 682.0347 505.2628 758.2836 ] /DA (//Helvetica 12 Tf 0 g)
/F 4 /M (D:20260421191242Z00'00') /Subtype /FreeText /Type /Annot /BS << /W
0 >> >> /AAPL:AKAnnotationObject ()
>> /F 4 /BS << /W 0 >> /Subtype /FreeText /DA (//Helvetica 12 Tf 0 g) /Border
[ 0 0 0 ] /Type /Annot /Rect [ 39.20819 682.0347 505.2628 758.2836 ] /M (D:20260421191242Z00'00')
/AP << /N 1189 0 R >> /Contents (This paper introduced  the first end to end architecture.\012For this architecture, object recognition and patch reordering could use the same network backbone,\012which means the convolutional learning structure and the pretrained models use the same architecture.\012the task is based on the object recognition. \012It extracted the unchangeable features from the labeled data through supervised task, and adaptively fixed the features through unsupervised task.\012the experiment tested on several dataset for 3x3 size\012what the results showed\0121.the unsupervised method is less likely to tell the semantic info correctly\0122.if the weight of the loss alpha is high, the data bais to the relevant radio between the images ordered and shulffed could impact the accuracy significantly.)
/T (yanxia) >>
endobj
